Package: opencheck
Title: Split-Sample Construct Checks for Open-Text Responses in Survey Experiments
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Steven", "Denney", email = "s.c.denney@hum.leidenuniv.nl",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tests whether a randomized treatment changes the considerations
    respondents articulate in open-text answers. Discovery and codebook work
    happen on a discovery fold only; the measurement is frozen into a hashed
    lockfile before the estimation fold can be read, so the coding scheme is
    never tuned on the data used to estimate the treatment contrast.
